invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser_ext.c
catches: srv_test
reason: read_record_size_limit admits 63, one below the smallest limit RFC
  8449 §4 lets a peer send, which the section makes a fatal
  illegal_parameter. The boundary pair in test/srv_parser_tests.h
  requires 64 to parse and 63 to be refused.

--- old
    if (limit < RECORD_SIZE_LIMIT_MIN) {
--- new
    if (limit < RECORD_SIZE_LIMIT_MIN - 1) {
